<div id="urduTextPath">امام جعفر صادق (ع)/بے چین دل تھے حضرتِ باقر کی یاد میں</div>

<p>bechain dil the hazrate baquar ki yaad me<br />
saamaane gham tha farq-e paak aiteqaad me<br />
tha jashn-e eid qaana-e ahle anaad me<br />
goya bahaar aai thi baagh-e muraad me</p>

<p>qush the ke baawaroo-e shajar-e mud'duaa huwa<br />
ek taaza gul ali ke chaman se judaa huwa<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>din raath ahle shar isi tadbeer me the aah<br />
qairul bashar ka naam mitaa de wo rusiyaah<br />
par qalq reh na sakti thi be hujjat-e ilaah<br />
baqsha quda ne jaafar-e saadiq ko izz-o jaah</p>

<p>jauhar kushaa-e taqt-e karaamat huwe huzoor<br />
rounaq fizaa-e taqt-e imaamat huwe huzoor<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>qurbaa'n malak the jaffar-e sadiq ki shaan par<br />
haafiz fida the mus'hif-e naatiq ki shaan par<br />
maula toh jaan dete the khaaliq ki shaan par<br />
maashooq ko bhi naaz tha aashiq ki shaan par</p>

<p>qaail zubaa'n har ek munafiq ki hogayi<br />
aalam me dhoom ulfat-e sadiq ki hogayi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>raazi qazaa pe tha woh jigar band-e murtuza<br />
karta hai ek shaks ye wasfe shahe huda<br />
beemaar koyi aapka tha tifl mehlaqaa<br />
daulat saraa pe uski ayaadat ko mai gaya</p>

<p>hazrat khade huve the jhuka mai salaam ko<br />
paaya magar udaas imam-e anaam ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>andar gaye huzoor mai tehraa raha wahi'n<br />
dekha yeh wapasi mai ke gham ka asar nahi'n<br />
mai ne kaha ke shaad rakhe rab-ul alamee'n<br />
shehzaada khairiyat se hai aye baadshahe dee'n</p>

<p>farmaaya woh mareez jahaa'n sey guzar gaya<br />
ladke ka haal dekh ke aaya hoo'n margayaa<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>poocha ka pehle ranj tha ab kyu'n nahi'n malaal<br />
bole hum ahleybait-e nabi ka yahi hai haal<br />
gham ka dum-e nuzool bhalaa karte hai khayaal<br />
naazil woh hogayi to kiya shukr-e zuljalaal</p>

<p>tasleem kis tarha na raza kibriya ki ho<br />
bande ka dakhl kya jo mashiyat khuda ki ho<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>maasoom ki qazaa-e ilaahi pe thi nazar<br />
kyu'n kar na ho hussain se saaber ke the jigar<br />
hai aashkaar himmath-e shabbire naamwar<br />
pardes me lutaadiya aabaad apna ghar</p>

<p>raah-e quda me dil ko sambhaala imaam ne<br />
aulaad zib'ha hogayi aankhou'n ke saamne<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>baqar ke laqte dil ko na aya kabhi ghazab<br />
taaba khuda ke hukm ka tha sarwar-e arab<br />
karta tha sabr naasir-e deen-e habib-e rab<br />
deta tha sadme aapko mansoor-e be adab</p>

<p>firoune asr phir gaya faqre kaleem se<br />
keena tha sange saqt ko durr-e yateem se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>rehti thi usko shaam-o saher fikr-e qatl-e shaah<br />
jalta tha aaftaab-e imaamat se rusiyaah<br />
thi aarzu ke qaana-e hyder ho phir tabaah<br />
ho be imaam qaadim-e sultaane dee'n panaah</p>

<p>saadaath mubtelaa-e balaa-e azeem ho<br />
jaffar ho qatl moosi-e kaazim yateem ho<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>zaalim ko be gunaah se manzoor thi daghaa<br />
makkaar ne iraq me aakhir talab kiya<br />
karta raha iraada-e qatl-e shahe huda<br />
aijaz taaza dekh ke kar deta tha rehaa</p>

<p>tegh-e sitam nikaalta tha jab niyam se<br />
chal sakta tha na zor dua-e imam se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sad haif sang dil ko na kuch iska tha khayaal<br />
mehmaa'n maraa hai gulshan-e baquar ka nounehaal<br />
mansoor ka bhi tark-e wafaa me wohi tha haal<br />
jaise yazeed-o ibn-e ziyaad-e zaboo'n qisaal</p>

<p>kis tarha zaalimou'n ne sataaya hussain ko<br />
loota bula ke ghar se shah-e mashraqain ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>haq ke wali ka dushman-e jaani tha rusiyaah<br />
sab aafato'n se bach ke watan me jab aaye shaah<br />
wo zulm hogaya ke madina hua tabaah<br />
angoor me imaam ko dilwaaya zehr aah</p>

<p>sarw-e riyaaz-e dee'n ka ajab haal hogaya<br />
sar sabz baagh-e deen ka paamaal hogaya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>paate the jis se rizq masaakeen-o be nawaa<br />
us ghar me khaak udne lagi waa musibataa<br />
milkar pidar se moosiye kaazim ne ki bukaa<br />
hazrat ne waqte naz'aa jo unko wasi kiyaa</p>

<p>hontou'n pe dam tha mout thi aankhou'n ke saamne<br />
bulwaaya sab azizo'n ko usdam imaam ne<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>naagaah band hogayi aawaaz dard naak<br />
pahonchi jawaar-e rahmat-e qaaleq me rooh-e paak<br />
tegh-e alam se dil hue beto'n ke chaak chaak<br />
tar hogaya yatimou'n ke ashko'n se farsh-e khaak</p>

<p>fikre kafan wasi-e shah-e ins-o ja'n ne ki<br />
tadbeer-e ghusl-e shaah imam-e zamaa'n ne ki<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>